# task.toml — NO CHANGE REQUIRED.
#
# The rubric judge is a SUB-AGENT: it writes a request file and reads a verdict file, and
# never calls a model from inside the verifier. So there is no [verifier.env] block, no
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL, no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, and no JUDGE_MODEL anywhere in the task.
#
# (An earlier draft of this template added credentials here. That was the legacy "api"
# judge backend. Do not add them: if you find them in a task, delete them.)
